      "writtenOn": "2021-02-09T22:01:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of modifying the open/close ops directly, can we have a global const vm_operations_struct with all ops defined Kalesh? It would kind of be like a shim layer that would just call the exporter_defined vm_ops directly. The dummy ops could all be static inline functions in dma_buf_sysfs_stats.c/h to avoid clutter here and the exporter defined vm_ops struct would be stashed in struct dma_buf. Do you think that could work?",
